            <history xml:id="history_395N201FD">
               <p xml:id="idm150">This is a collection of excerpts from earlier works such as the piano sonatas in G minor and F major, combined with newly composed material. Originally Hartmann had called the collection "Nyt og Fornyet", a better description of the content than the title on the printed edition. Nothing is known about the circumstances surrounding the publication of this work in 1878 is known.</p>
            </history>
