      <manifestationList xml:id="sourceDesc_6b97dcdb">
         <manifestation label="" xml:id="source_d1e38">
            <titleStmt xml:id="titleStmt_2129177c">
               <title xml:id="title_395N2004A">Sketch</title>
            </titleStmt>
            <physDesc xml:id="physDesc_24ee50d8">
               <titlePage label="Title page" xml:id="titlePage_395N2005B">
                  <p xml:id="idm32">Nyt og Fornyet / Fantasistykker / for Pianoforte / af / I:P:E: Hartmann</p>
               </titlePage>
               <extent xml:id="extent_7b4af5df">38 pages</extent>
               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_9d9698f1">35 x 26</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_b1c413e2">Paginated 1-19 and 23-35 and one unpaginated folio with corrections for pp. 13, 14, 24 and 25. The missing pages 20-22 are to be found in the manuscript from 1854 for the the F major sonata. They have been removed from the sonata by Hartmann in order to be reused as the third movement of Opus 74. Paper: pp. 1-5: 14 staves; pp. 6-13: 12 staves; pp. 14-27: 14 staves; pp. 28-35: 12 staves. With numerous corrections in pencil, purple crayon and purple ink. At the end of No. 4 on p. 27 dated "20/3 77".</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
            <notesStmt xml:id="notesStmt_8809f22b">
               <annot type="source_description" xml:id="annot_395N2006D">
                  <p xml:id="idm38">Contents: nos. 1, 2, 4 and 5 (bb. 1-70). Lengthy passages in No.1 are based on the G minor sonata of 1851. Only bb. 45-64 are completely without connection to the model. No. 2 is the only piece without any relation to earlier works, but the handwriting of the pencil corrections indicates that the original work is earlier. No. 3 is the second movement of the F major sonata and No. 4 the third movement. In No. 5 the first 10 bars are identical with the first 10 bars of the G minor sonata.</p>
               </annot>
            </notesStmt>
